%U A036060 5658676,11059944,21696217,42670207,84144931,166369709,329734120,655015587,1303919820,2601140151
%N A036060 Number of 3-component Carmichael numbers C = (6M + 1)(12M + 1)(18M + 1) < 10^n.
%C A036060 Note that this is different from the count of 3-Carmichael numbers, A132195. The numbers counted here are neither those listed in A087788 (3 arbitrary prime factors) nor those listed in A033502 (where 6m + 1, 12m + 1 and 18m + 1 are all prime). - _M. F. Hasler_, Apr 14 2015
